      "client": [ "withAuth" ],
      "$comment": "Chosen through the hand-written AuthMode choice (none/authorization/oidc), so the generator emits no parameter for it; a feature that requires it still switches it on. It requires Migrations: the package ships migrations (M_202610041800, M_202610051200) that only the app's AddMigrations() runs. alsoRequires Mail: the template maps registration (LocalCredentials = Full), and startup refuses that without a mail transport (LocalCredentialEndpointFilter.GuardAgainstRegistrationWithoutMail); in Development Mail writes the confirmation links to .eml files."
